  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "以扑克出完手牌为基础，引入DBG构筑并通过连锁反应改写传统牌局节奏。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Built on the classic poker objective of “getting rid of all your cards,” Apokerlypse blends in deep deckbuilding roguelike mechanics, making every run a chance to unleash outrageous chain reactions that will leave you stunned.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3481020/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "异步对战会调用真实玩家创建的技能、筹码和牌组构筑，要求逐局寻找弱点。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Every battle pits you against card builds created by real players in asynchronous multiplayer. They come armed with unique skills, chip combinations, and personalized decks of their own. Find their weaknesses, and do whatever it takes to defeat them!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3481020/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "四百种筹码可直接重塑核心机制并打破常规牌局规则，扩大构筑空间。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "400 chips that reshape core mechanics and completely break the conventional rules of card play",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3481020/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
